OL,3,GNEWSARecycling centres to close for
OL,4,Arepair works
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicestershire County Council has said
OL,7,Fa programme of essential improvement
OL,8,Fworks will be carried out at three
OL,9,Frecycling and household waste sites
OL,10,Fover autumn and winter.
OL,12,FIt said the Mountsorrel site will close
OL,13,Ftemporarily from Tuesday 27 October to
OL,14,Fallow repairs to the concrete base in
OL,15,Fthe bottom yard to be carried out.
OL,17,FThe works are designed to ensure the
OL,18,Fsite remains safe to operate for the
OL,19,Ffuture. It is due to reopen in early
OL,20,FDecember.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
